+ *
+ * The A72 station with CPU voltage scaling: CPU0-7 and the CCI follow the
+ * vendor's MT6797 operating points with VPROC1 (DA9214 BUCKA) and the SRAM
+ * LDO (VSRAM_L) set for each. Nothing changes a voltage until the regulator,
+ * clock and cpufreq modules load.
+ *
+ * Each point's voltage is the higher of the vendor base table and this unit's
+ * EEM-calibrated value plus the vendor's 62.5 mV adder at or below 33 C,
+ * capped at the vendor's 1.2 V and rounded up to the DA9214's 10 mV step.
+ * The EEM values come from this unit's Gemian capture, so this file is for
+ * this unit (experiments/2026-11-08-mt6797-a53-dvfs).
+ */
